<section class="plain-intro" aria-labelledby="what-title">
  <div class="intro-grid wrap">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">What is Panamensis?</p><h2 id="what-title">A history scattered across many places.</h2></div>
    <div class="intro-copy">
      <p><strong>Why it exists</strong>For more than a century, Panama has been a meeting place for tropical research, international expeditions, biological collecting, conservation and the study of the natural world. The records of that history are now dispersed across institutions, countries and collections.</p>
      <p><strong>What it does</strong>Panamensis finds those records, connects them and uses them to tell stories about the people, places, organisms and institutions through which knowledge about Panama was created.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

